---
// OriginStory.astro
---

<section id="origin" class="relative py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 bg-munches-cream border-b-4 border-munches-navy text-munches-navy">
  
  <!-- Cheese wave background elements -->
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-block bg-munches-orange text-munches-cream text-xs font-black tracking-widest uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-full border-2 border-munches-navy shadow-pop-sm mb-3">
        THE ACCIDENTAL EMPIRE
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-bubble text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black text-munches-navy tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Born From a Costco Cart & a TikTok Joke.
      </h2>
      <p class="font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-munches-navy/80 mt-3">
        How an obsession with wholesale club macros turned into the most iconic snack ritual of our generation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- The 3 Chapter Narrative Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8 mb-16">
      
      <!-- Chapter 1: The Costco Secret -->
      <div class="bg-munches-ivory border-4 border-munches-navy rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-pop-navy flex flex-col justify-between relative group hover:translate-y-[-4px] transition-transform">
        <div class="absolute -top-4 -left-3 bg-munches-yellow border-2 border-munches-navy px-2.5 py-1 rounded-xl text-xs font-black shadow-sm">
          CHAPTER 01
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <div class="text-4xl mb-4 mt-2">🛒</div>
          <h3 class="font-bubble text-2xl font-black text-munches-navy mb-3">
            The Costco Macro Cheat Code
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-munches-navy/85 leading-relaxed">
            It started in the cold walk-in dairy cooler. While everyone else was dropping $4.00 on synthetic, chalky protein bars loaded with 28 lab ingredients and gut-wrecking sugar alcohols, the smartest eaters were quietly buying generic bulk cheese sticks.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 bg-[#FFEEC7] border-2 border-munches-navy rounded-2xl p-3 text-xs font-black">
          <span class="text-munches-orange">THE MATH:</span> 80 calories. 7g real dairy protein. 0g sugar. Under a dollar per stick. The ultimate nutritional cheat code.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Chapter 2: The Viral Moment -->
      <div class="bg-munches-yellow border-4 border-munches-navy rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-pop-navy flex flex-col justify-between relative group hover:translate-y-[-4px] transition-transform">
        <div class="absolute -top-4 -left-3 bg-munches-orange text-munches-cream border-2 border-munches-navy px-2.5 py-1 rounded-xl text-xs font-black shadow-sm">
          CHAPTER 02
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="text-4xl mb-4 mt-2">📱</div>
          <h3 class="font-bubble text-2xl font-black text-munches-navy mb-3">
            "To Take The Edge Off"
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-munches-navy/85 leading-relaxed">
            Then came the TikTok video: someone stepped outside the office, pulled out a string cheese stick, held it between two fingers like a cigarette, and declared: 
            <em class="font-black text-munches-navy">"Just a little something to take the edge off."</em>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 bg-munches-cream border-2 border-munches-navy rounded-2xl p-3 text-xs font-black">
          <span class="text-munches-navy">THE EPIPHANY:</span> Why should "taking a break" belong to bad habits? Stepping away for a satisfying cheese stick was the healthiest habit in human history.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Chapter 3: The Flip-Top Innovation -->
      <div class="bg-munches-orange text-munches-cream border-4 border-munches-navy rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-pop-navy flex flex-col justify-between relative group hover:translate-y-[-4px] transition-transform">
        <div class="absolute -top-4 -left-3 bg-munches-cream text-munches-navy border-2 border-munches-navy px-2.5 py-1 rounded-xl text-xs font-black shadow-sm">
          CHAPTER 03
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="text-4xl mb-4 mt-2">📦</div>
          <h3 class="font-bubble text-2xl font-black text-munches-cream mb-3">
            The Tactile Flip-Top Pack
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-munches-cream/90 leading-relaxed">
            No more squished, sweaty string cheese floating loose in the bottom of your gym backpack. We engineered a pocket-ready cardboard carton that flips open smoothly from the top, holding 6 individually wrapped sticks.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 bg-munches-navy text-munches-yellow border-2 border-munches-cream rounded-2xl p-3 text-xs font-black">
          <span class="text-white">THE RESULT:</span> Flip with your thumb. Slide one out. Peel. Snack. Repeat. ◡
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Interactive TikTok Mockup & Surgeon General Parody Bar -->
    <div class="bg-munches-ivory border-4 border-munches-navy rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-pop-navy-lg flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-8">
      
      <!-- Video Card Simulation -->
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 bg-munches-navy rounded-2xl p-4 border-3 border-munches-navy text-white shadow-pop-sm relative overflow-hidden">
        <!-- Mock TikTok UI Top Header -->
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-white/70 mb-3 border-b border-white/10 pb-2">
          <span class="font-black text-munches-yellow">#CheeseStickCheats</span>
          <span>4.8M views</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Simulated Video Frame -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-munches-sky to-[#156082] rounded-xl p-6 text-center relative border border-white/20">
          <div class="inline-block bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-md px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-bold text-white mb-4">
            3:15 PM • Midday Slump Break
          </div>
          <div class="text-6xl mb-2">✌️🧀</div>
          <div class="font-bubble text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-munches-cream leading-tight text-shadow-pop">
            "Just a little something to take the edge off."
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-munches-yellow mt-3 bg-munches-navy/80 inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-lg border border-white/20">
            *crushes 7g protein in 30 seconds*
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Comments ticker -->
        <div class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-xs">
          <div class="bg-white/10 p-2 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="font-black text-munches-yellow">@jimmy_gains:</span>
            <span class="text-white/90">"I literally haven't bought a $4 protein bar since I realized string cheese exists."</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white/10 p-2 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="font-black text-munches-yellow">@sarah_deskjob:</span>
            <span class="text-white/90">"The flip-top carton in the board room was a power move."</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: The Core Manifesto & Surgeon General Style Warning -->
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-munches-orange">
            BRAND MANIFESTO
          </span>
          <h3 class="font-bubble text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-munches-navy mt-1 mb-3">
            Real Food. Zero Pretentiousness. 100% Mozzarella.
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-munches-navy/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            We don't believe you should have to choke down dry whey isolates or spend $35 a week on snacks that taste like cardboard. 
            Munches is built on four non-negotiable pillars: <strong>Taste</strong>, <strong>Quality</strong>, <strong>Elite Macros</strong>, and <strong>Affordability</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Surgeon General Parody Notice Box -->
        <div class="bg-white border-3 border-munches-navy p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-pop-sm">
          <div class="font-black text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-munches-navy border-b border-munches-navy/30 pb-1 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="bg-munches-orange text-white px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[9px]">NOTICE</span>
            <span>SNACKER GENERAL'S ADVISORY:</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold text-munches-navy/90 leading-tight">
            Replacing chalky artificial fitness snacks with fresh Munches cheese sticks may cause spontaneous smiling, enhanced muscle recovery, and coworkers asking: <em>"Hey, can I bum a cheese stick?"</em>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
